# SAP AI Core credentials for the evaluation harness.
# Copy to .env and fill in real values. .env is git-ignored (.gitignore: .env / *.env)
# — NEVER commit real secrets, and never put the VALUES in config.yaml/config.py.
#
# Option A (recommended): client-credentials — the harness mints & auto-refreshes
# tokens, so long runs never die mid-way.
AICORE_CLIENT_ID=
AICORE_CLIENT_SECRET=
AICORE_AUTH_URL=https://<subdomain>.authentication.<region>.hana.ondemand.com

# Option B: a static bearer token (used verbatim, no refresh — expires in ~4h).
# If set, it takes priority over the client-credentials vars above.
# AICORE_BEARER_TOKEN=

# Optional: Hugging Face token for gated/rate-limited dataset downloads (FLEURS is public).
# HF_TOKEN=
